
# EventType: 2896852170
# Descriptor: [e+ e- -> J/psi [-> l+ l-] X->[D*+ (tag) D*- (miss)]]
# NickName: ee_Jpsi_DstDst
# Documentation: Double charmonium production.
# Tested:
# PhysicsWG: Quarkonium
# Responsible: Jiyuan Zhang
# Email: jiyuanzhang24@m.fudan.edu.cn
# Cuts: None
# Date: 20261010

Alias Myjpsi J/psi
Alias myD*+ D*+
Alias myD*- D*-

Alias myD0 D0
Alias myantiD0 anti-D0

Alias myK_S0 K_S0
Alias mypi0 pi0

ChargeConj myD*+ myD*-
ChargeConj myD0 myantiD0

Decay vpho
1.00 Myjpsi X4160 PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay X4160
0.5 myD*+ D*- PHSP;
0.5 D*+ myD*- PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay Myjpsi
0.05971 e+ e- PHOTOS VLL;
0.05961 mu+ mu- PHOTOS VLL;
Enddecay

Decay myD*+
0.677 myD0 pi+ PHOTOS PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay myD*-

Decay myD0
0.03945 K- pi+ PHSP;
0.02860 myK_S0 pi+ pi- D_DALITZ;
0.14400 pi+ K- mypi0 D_DALITZ;
0.00408 K- K+ PHSP;
0.08220 K- pi+ pi+ pi- PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay myantiD0

Decay myK_S0
1.000 pi+ pi- PHSP;
Enddecay

Decay mypi0
1.000 gamma gamma PHSP;
Enddecay

End
